<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:02.619" end="00:00:04.639" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.100" end="00:00:09.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHERE AM I GOING? [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.790" end="00:00:13.810" style="s2">[cough]</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.410" end="00:00:19.800" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.000" end="00:00:19.800" style="s2">MOM, HOLD ON. PLEASE STAY with me, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.000" end="00:00:31.440" style="s2">I can&#39;t save her,</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.800" end="00:00:33.460" style="s2">but this coin might give you a miracle.</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.440" end="00:00:33.460" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.060" end="00:00:37.100" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.900" end="00:00:38.800" style="s2">Please</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.100" end="00:00:41.200" style="s2">make my mom better.</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.800" end="00:00:41.200" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.540" end="00:00:46.560" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.800" end="00:00:52.455" style="s2">WHERE AM I GOING? [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.400" end="00:01:06.600" style="s2">IT BENT.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.500" end="00:01:17.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU MAY GO.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.900" end="00:01:22.900" style="s2">YOUR MAJESTY, THAT WAS THE last group.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.900" end="00:01:22.900" style="s2">No one can get near you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.400" end="00:01:29.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.100" end="00:01:34.500" style="s2">If no woman willingly joins with you</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.000" end="00:01:36.600" style="s2">within 6 months,</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.500" end="00:01:38.500" style="s2">so this is my fate.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.600" end="00:01:41.300" style="s2">The first world&#39;s king</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.500" end="00:01:43.300" style="s2">to die from the curse.</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.300" end="00:01:44.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your majesty, there&#39;s still hope. There</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.300" end="00:01:46.500" style="s2">must be</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.200" end="00:01:48.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hope?</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.500" end="00:01:48.800" style="s2">Where?</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.300" end="00:01:55.900" style="s2">Will it just fall out of the sky?</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.892" end="00:02:21.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.592" end="00:02:23.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.692" end="00:02:24.792" style="s2">don&#39;t feel any pain.</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.592" end="00:02:27.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pain?</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.792" end="00:02:27.292" style="s2">Why would I</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.792" end="00:02:30.692" style="s2">Where am I?</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.392" end="00:02:32.492" style="s2">Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.692" end="00:02:34.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Karen Wells.</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.492" end="00:02:35.592" style="s2">This is Dragon Cult.</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.192" end="00:02:39.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Karen Wells?</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.592" end="00:02:39.092" style="s2">I landed in the Dragon King&#39;s lap?</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.792" end="00:02:46.592" style="s2">Ow, that hurt. I&#39;m not dreaming.</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.026" end="00:02:50.792" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.792" end="00:02:52.392" style="s2">The Dragon King, he can save Mom. Please</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.792" end="00:02:54.292" style="s2">save my mom.</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.392" end="00:02:57.292" style="s2">She has a deadly fever. No one can cure</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.292" end="00:02:57.292" style="s2">her. Please help her.</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.437" end="00:03:04.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.192" end="00:03:05.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can cure your mother</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.292" end="00:03:06.792" style="s2">on one condition.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.692" end="00:03:09.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything.</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.792" end="00:03:09.692" style="s2">Just save my mom.</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.592" end="00:03:18.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marry me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.592" end="00:03:25.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marry him?</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.892" end="00:03:29.192" style="s2">Is he crazy? We met five minutes ago.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.792" end="00:03:29.192" style="s2">Did he fall for me that fast?</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.592" end="00:03:35.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be my queen for six months.</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.692" end="00:03:35.992" style="s2">After that, you&#39;re free to leave.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.462" end="00:03:39.482" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.392" end="00:03:46.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.992" end="00:03:46.492" style="s2">I&#39;ll do it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.392" end="00:04:01.697" style="s2">Leah,</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.392" end="00:04:03.662" style="s2">my</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.697" end="00:04:05.682" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.662" end="00:04:05.682" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.282" end="00:04:09.094" style="s2">[laughter] Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.594" end="00:04:11.494" style="s2">You&#39;re awake.</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.094" end="00:04:13.194" style="s2">I thought I&#39;d lost you forever.</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.494" end="00:04:14.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay.</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.194" end="00:04:17.494" style="s2">I&#39;m better now.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.794" end="00:04:17.494" style="s2">Don&#39;t [snorts] cry.</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.994" end="00:04:26.994" style="s2">Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.694" end="00:04:28.194" style="s2">I&#39;m getting married.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.994" end="00:04:30.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Married?</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.194" end="00:04:31.594" style="s2">To whom?</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.194" end="00:04:34.394" style="s2">Someone</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.594" end="00:04:34.394" style="s2">pretty powerful?</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.994" end="00:04:41.653" style="s2">As long as he treats you right, I&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.594" end="00:04:43.673" style="s2">happy.</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.653" end="00:04:43.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.594" end="00:04:50.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our queen is a human with no magic at</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.794" end="00:04:52.094" style="s2">all.</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.494" end="00:04:53.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Haven&#39;t you heard? She&#39;s the only one</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.094" end="00:04:55.094" style="s2">who can touch him without getting</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.094" end="00:04:56.994" style="s2">burned. All those noble ladies can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.094" end="00:04:59.294" style="s2">even touch him, so she gets to marry</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.994" end="00:04:59.294" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.694" end="00:05:10.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nervous?</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.194" end="00:05:12.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve never had this many people staring</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.794" end="00:05:13.894" style="s2">at me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.794" end="00:05:15.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ignore them.</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.894" end="00:05:18.333" style="s2">This is our wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.294" end="00:05:20.353" style="s2">Keep your eyes on me and your heart.</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.333" end="00:05:20.353" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.994" end="00:05:38.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We button up your shirt.</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.294" end="00:05:53.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this already too much for you?</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.594" end="00:05:58.694" style="s2">It&#39;s our wedding night.</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.394" end="00:05:59.694" style="s2">If you&#39;re this shy now, how will we get</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.694" end="00:06:03.294" style="s2">any further?</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.694" end="00:06:03.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, wait. I&#39;m I&#39;m not ready.</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.194" end="00:06:09.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be afraid.</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.694" end="00:06:11.995" style="s2">We have six months. There&#39;s no rush.</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.195" end="00:06:11.995" style="s2">I&#39;ll wait until you&#39;re ready.</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.904" end="00:06:21.924" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.995" end="00:06:24.895" style="s2">Good night, my queen.</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.195" end="00:06:32.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So this is the mighty dragon king</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.895" end="00:06:34.395" style="s2">asleep.</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.495" end="00:06:36.995" style="s2">He almost looks</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.395" end="00:06:36.995" style="s2">vulnerable.</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.495" end="00:06:42.174" style="s2">Am I losing my mind? I actually wanted</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.495" end="00:06:44.194" style="s2">to touch him.</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.174" end="00:06:44.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.034" end="00:06:54.395" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.195" end="00:06:55.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve stolen all the covers.</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.395" end="00:06:58.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.895" end="00:06:58.995" style="s2">Sorry. We&#39;ll take it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.204" end="00:07:01.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.795" end="00:07:16.889" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, what happened? Are you</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.595" end="00:07:18.199" style="s2">hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.889" end="00:07:20.219" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cough]</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.199" end="00:07:20.219" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.495" end="00:07:24.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Karen&#39;s been so busy. I wanted to cook</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.195" end="00:07:27.195" style="s2">for him, but</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.395" end="00:07:27.195" style="s2">I blew up the kitchen.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.025" end="00:07:30.045" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.395" end="00:07:36.195" style="s2">I put my heart into it. It should be</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.695" end="00:07:36.195" style="s2">edible.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.595" end="00:07:42.095" style="s2">Karen, take a break. I made you</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.695" end="00:07:42.095" style="s2">something.</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.995" end="00:07:51.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have servants for this. You don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.695" end="00:07:51.295" style="s2">have to cook.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.195" end="00:07:56.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.295" end="00:07:59.095" style="s2">I just wanted to do something special</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.695" end="00:07:59.095" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.895" end="00:08:04.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s delicious.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.995" end="00:08:08.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll cook for you every day.</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.497" end="00:08:11.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d like that.</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.297" end="00:08:19.770" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Karen,</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.397" end="00:08:21.790" style="s2">what&#39;s wrong? Did my food poison you?</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.770" end="00:08:21.790" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.905" end="00:08:32.925" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.897" end="00:08:37.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be scared.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.497" end="00:08:41.597" style="s2">I&#39;m all right.</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.997" end="00:08:41.597" style="s2">It stops hurting when I&#39;m close to you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.097" end="00:08:56.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare that lowly human touch him?</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.797" end="00:08:56.697" style="s2">Karen is mine.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.197" end="00:09:08.397" style="s2">So you&#39;re Leah,</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.397" end="00:09:11.697" style="s2">a lowly human in our castle?</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.397" end="00:09:11.697" style="s2">Get out of here while you still can.</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.597" end="00:09:15.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not leaving.</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.497" end="00:09:20.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who do you think you are?</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.297" end="00:09:23.597" style="s2">No noble blood, no power. You don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.397" end="00:09:23.597" style="s2">belong beside our king.</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.997" end="00:09:27.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. A mere human isn&#39;t worthy of</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.297" end="00:09:30.097" style="s2">his majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.997" end="00:09:32.597" style="s2">She just got lucky. She won&#39;t last three</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.097" end="00:09:34.497" style="s2">days. Only a noble lady like Miss Rowen</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.597" end="00:09:36.497" style="s2">deserves to be our queen.</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.497" end="00:09:39.897" style="s2">Hear that? No one thinks you belong</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.497" end="00:09:39.897" style="s2">here. Get lost.</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.697" end="00:09:45.576" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If a human doesn&#39;t belong here, why am I</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.297" end="00:09:47.596" style="s2">your queen?</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.576" end="00:09:47.596" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.851" end="00:09:52.297" style="s2">[snorts] You little witch.</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.897" end="00:09:54.997" style="s2">I&#39;ll tear you apart and drag you off</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.297" end="00:09:54.997" style="s2">that throne.</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.912" end="00:10:25.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.898" end="00:10:26.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena,</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.398" end="00:10:28.898" style="s2">you&#39;ve crossed the line.</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.998" end="00:10:30.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have?</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.898" end="00:10:32.898" style="s2">I&#39;d endure the agony of your curse just</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.798" end="00:10:35.798" style="s2">to be close to you, and you scold me</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.898" end="00:10:35.798" style="s2">over this human?</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.198" end="00:10:43.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I chose Leah as my queen.</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.598" end="00:10:43.498" style="s2">No one disrespects her.</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.872" end="00:10:45.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.398" end="00:10:51.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good heavens. He means it. He&#39;s furious</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.098" end="00:10:53.698" style="s2">over a human. He even snapped at Miss</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.898" end="00:10:57.998" style="s2">Rowan. We better not cross the queen.</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.698" end="00:10:57.998" style="s2">Serena lost to a human. How humiliating.</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.937" end="00:11:00.957" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.998" end="00:11:07.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you,</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.798" end="00:11:13.398" style="s2">you will treat Leah as you treat me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.698" end="00:11:15.898" style="s2">An insult to her is an act against the</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.398" end="00:11:15.898" style="s2">crown.</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.698" end="00:11:27.198" style="s2">Everyone who insulted the queen gets</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.798" end="00:11:29.498" style="s2">three months hard labor in the hills.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.198" end="00:11:30.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mercy, your majesties. We were wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.498" end="00:11:33.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ve learned their lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.998" end="00:11:33.998" style="s2">Please spare them this once.</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.398" end="00:11:40.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The queen has spared you. [laughter] If</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.398" end="00:11:43.198" style="s2">this happens again, you know the</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.398" end="00:11:43.198" style="s2">consequences.</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.098" end="00:11:52.048" style="s2">Are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.028" end="00:11:52.048" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.398" end="00:11:57.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one&#39;s ever cared for me like this</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.698" end="00:11:58.298" style="s2">except mom.</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.098" end="00:12:00.898" style="s2">Oh no.</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.298" end="00:12:02.598" style="s2">I think I&#39;m falling for Karen.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.898" end="00:12:05.598" style="s2">But this marriage is just a contract. It</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.598" end="00:12:05.598" style="s2">has to end someday.</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.498" end="00:12:09.698" style="s2">Maybe a gift he&#39;d love would bring us</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.698" end="00:12:11.698" style="s2">closer.</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.698" end="00:12:12.799" style="s2">But I don&#39;t even know what he likes.</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.698" end="00:12:16.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Karen, you won&#39;t break</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.799" end="00:12:16.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; curse. make sure you die.</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.299" end="00:12:23.599" style="s2">Sitting here all alone.</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.099" end="00:12:23.599" style="s2">Something wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.699" end="00:12:26.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.999" end="00:12:29.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.299" end="00:12:30.899" style="s2">I&#39;m Marcus, Karen&#39;s cousin.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.599" end="00:12:34.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His cousin?</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.899" end="00:12:34.099" style="s2">Then you must know what he likes.</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.399" end="00:12:41.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He loves rich, sugary nectar cakes.</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.199" end="00:12:47.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nectar cakes? Got it. What else?</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.358" end="00:12:48.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.099" end="00:12:49.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As a boy, he&#39;d tear the kitchen apart</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.399" end="00:12:51.099" style="s2">for one.</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.599" end="00:12:52.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.099" end="00:12:53.999" style="s2">Karen did that?</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.299" end="00:12:55.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And he hated company.</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.999" end="00:12:57.799" style="s2">He&#39;d turn into a dragon and fly off all</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.499" end="00:12:57.799" style="s2">day.</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.099" end="00:13:03.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s why he&#39;s so quiet. He likes to</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.299" end="00:13:03.099" style="s2">seem mysterious.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.599" end="00:13:07.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He also loves ancient books.</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.899" end="00:13:09.499" style="s2">He&#39;ll read all afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.999" end="00:13:13.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That explains all those old books in his</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.499" end="00:13:13.099" style="s2">study. I can&#39;t read any of them.</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.899" end="00:13:20.099" style="s2">Thank you so much. I know just what to</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.699" end="00:13:20.099" style="s2">do.</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.299" end="00:13:36.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s never smiled at me like that.</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.799" end="00:13:47.299" style="s2">No wonder she&#39;s so tense around me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.199" end="00:13:47.299" style="s2">It&#39;s Marcus she wants.</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.499" end="00:13:53.169" style="s2">I&#39;m only using her to break the curse.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.099" end="00:13:54.499" style="s2">Why does this hurt so much?</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.169" end="00:13:56.499" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.499" end="00:13:59.599" style="s2">Admit it, Karen.</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.499" end="00:13:59.599" style="s2">You&#39;re already in love with her.</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.299" end="00:14:08.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Karen will love these.</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.099" end="00:14:18.201" style="s2">Karen,</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.099" end="00:14:18.201" style="s2">I just made nectar cakes. Try one.</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.301" end="00:14:25.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nectar cakes?</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.101" end="00:14:28.601" style="s2">Marcus&#39;s favorite. Take them away. I</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.901" end="00:14:28.601" style="s2">don&#39;t want any.</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.501" end="00:14:35.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.701" end="00:14:35.001" style="s2">You liked my food last time.</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.801" end="00:14:39.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was sparing your feelings.</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.701" end="00:14:43.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.001" end="00:14:44.901" style="s2">I know I&#39;m not a good cook, but I worked</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.601" end="00:14:46.880" style="s2">so hard.</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.901" end="00:14:48.900" style="s2">Won&#39;t you try one?</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.880" end="00:14:48.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.601" end="00:14:52.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.101" end="00:14:55.101" style="s2">Don&#39;t you have anything better to do</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.301" end="00:14:55.101" style="s2">than bake cakes?</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.201" end="00:14:59.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just wanted to bake for someone I</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.801" end="00:14:59.201" style="s2">love.</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.325" end="00:15:02.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.001" end="00:15:04.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Spare me the lovesick act. It makes me</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.001" end="00:15:04.501" style="s2">sick.</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.701" end="00:15:18.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Karen,</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.801" end="00:15:18.101" style="s2">did you ever want me to stay?</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.301" end="00:15:21.301" style="s2">That jerk.</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.801" end="00:15:23.801" style="s2">If he doesn&#39;t love me, why did he lead</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.301" end="00:15:23.801" style="s2">me on?</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.215" end="00:15:26.890" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.870" end="00:15:26.890" style="s2">[laughter and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.110" end="00:15:32.130" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.501" end="00:15:45.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She hates me that much.</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.601" end="00:15:45.901" style="s2">She can&#39;t even bear my touch.</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.345" end="00:15:56.365" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.601" end="00:16:01.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hate this place.</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.301" end="00:16:03.901" style="s2">Another minute here and I&#39;ll lose my</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.501" end="00:16:03.901" style="s2">mind.</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.701" end="00:16:15.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s the queen? Why isn&#39;t she at</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.101" end="00:16:17.502" style="s2">breakfast?</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.901" end="00:16:21.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, she left with a bag this</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.502" end="00:16:21.002" style="s2">morning. She hasn&#39;t returned.</p>
<p begin="00:16:22.102" end="00:16:24.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.102" end="00:16:31.902" style="s2">Couldn&#39;t wait to leave me, could she?</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.302" end="00:16:31.902" style="s2">Let her go.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.902" end="00:16:40.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is the food not to your liking, your</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.102" end="00:16:43.702" style="s2">Majesty?</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.602" end="00:16:43.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take it away. It&#39;s awful.</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.902" end="00:17:07.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, the Queen still hasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.302" end="00:17:09.302" style="s2">returned.</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.706" end="00:17:13.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.302" end="00:17:13.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it. Where the hell is she?</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.911" end="00:17:18.502" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.702" end="00:17:18.502" style="s2">Where did the Queen go?</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.802" end="00:17:21.902" style="s2">Toward the western cliffs.</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.317" end="00:17:52.202" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.802" end="00:17:52.202" style="s2">Leah.</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.202" end="00:17:57.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help.</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.107" end="00:18:01.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and panting]</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.417" end="00:18:06.002" style="s2">[cough]</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.902" end="00:18:09.277" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Karen, have you lost your mind? Let go.</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.002" end="00:18:10.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;d rather die than stay with me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.277" end="00:18:12.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.602" end="00:18:14.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.202" end="00:18:15.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why bring a bag to a cliff weren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.002" end="00:18:17.792" style="s2">you going to jump?</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.102" end="00:18:19.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go first. I can&#39;t breathe.</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.792" end="00:18:21.303" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.202" end="00:18:24.103" style="s2">It&#39;s beautiful here. I just needed some</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.303" end="00:18:25.703" style="s2">air. I wasn&#39;t leaving you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.103" end="00:18:26.962" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enjoying the view?</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.703" end="00:18:28.982" style="s2">Then why bring a bag?</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.962" end="00:18:28.982" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.603" end="00:18:35.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just food.</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.403" end="00:18:37.903" style="s2">It&#39;s windy up here. Can&#39;t I bring some</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.803" end="00:18:39.003" style="s2">snack?</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.903" end="00:18:41.303" style="s2">Here.</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.003" end="00:18:41.303" style="s2">Want one?</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.703" end="00:18:44.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why were you laughing with Marcus</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.003" end="00:18:46.703" style="s2">yesterday?</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.903" end="00:18:49.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I asked him what you like. I wanted to</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.703" end="00:18:49.303" style="s2">make it for you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.603" end="00:18:53.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You made all this</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.203" end="00:18:56.203" style="s2">for me?</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.303" end="00:18:56.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who else would it be for?</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.503" end="00:19:03.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marcus lied to you. I hate those.</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.403" end="00:19:08.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.803" end="00:19:08.603" style="s2">He tricked me?</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.403" end="00:19:13.468" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you want to know anything, ask me.</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.603" end="00:19:14.703" style="s2">No more asking other men.</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.468" end="00:19:18.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.703" end="00:19:18.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. I will.</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.903" end="00:19:21.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want a view?</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.503" end="00:19:24.103" style="s2">I&#39;ll show you a real one.</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.803" end="00:19:24.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where?</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.603" end="00:19:34.403" style="s2">Karen.</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.803" end="00:19:34.403" style="s2">Karen.</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.503" end="00:20:02.103" style="s2">Can I</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.103" end="00:20:02.103" style="s2">really climb on?</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.108" end="00:20:14.903" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.903" end="00:20:14.903" style="s2">I&#39;m holding tight.</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.003" end="00:20:19.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.705" end="00:20:34.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, Karen.</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.005" end="00:20:34.105" style="s2">That&#39;s my village.</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.654" end="00:20:39.505" style="s2">[laughter and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.705" end="00:20:44.705" style="s2">WOW! [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.505" end="00:20:44.705" style="s2">WE&#39;RE FLYING. I FEEL so free.</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.169" end="00:20:47.189" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.754" end="00:20:51.774" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.374" end="00:20:56.805" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.805" end="00:20:59.505" style="s2">Karen, you did that on purpose. Slow</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.805" end="00:20:59.505" style="s2">down.</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.405" end="00:21:10.805" style="s2">What&#39;s that place?</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.005" end="00:21:10.805" style="s2">Can we check it out?</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.805" end="00:21:36.105" style="s2">What is this place?</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.005" end="00:21:36.105" style="s2">It&#39;s so desolate.</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.105" end="00:21:40.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My favorite place when I was a boy.</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.405" end="00:21:47.805" style="s2">I&#39;ve been cursed since birth.</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.505" end="00:21:49.805" style="s2">Anyone who touched me got burned.</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.805" end="00:21:54.105" style="s2">No one would play with me.</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.805" end="00:21:54.105" style="s2">I&#39;d hide here alone until dark.</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.460" end="00:22:05.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.505" end="00:22:08.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You won&#39;t have to wait alone anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.905" end="00:22:08.705" style="s2">I&#39;ll be here with you.</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.305" end="00:22:18.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.905" end="00:22:18.905" style="s2">I&#39;ll hold you to that.</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.605" end="00:22:30.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, Karen.</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.906" end="00:22:32.645" style="s2">Shooting stars.</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.625" end="00:22:32.645" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.795" end="00:22:41.815" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.006" end="00:22:55.106" style="s2">He&#39;s the Dragon King. I can&#39;t hold him</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.006" end="00:22:58.006" style="s2">back. I&#39;ll try my best to be good enough</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.106" end="00:22:58.006" style="s2">to stand beside him.</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.206" end="00:23:04.606" style="s2">Teach me dragon etiquette. I want to be</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.906" end="00:23:04.606" style="s2">a good queen.</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.206" end="00:23:08.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What brought this on?</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.506" end="00:23:11.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want to hide behind you. I want</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.306" end="00:23:12.506" style="s2">to stand beside you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.306" end="00:23:15.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.506" end="00:23:15.506" style="s2">I&#39;ll teach you myself.</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.301" end="00:23:28.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.706" end="00:23:32.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.906" end="00:23:34.506" style="s2">are you so close?</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.306" end="00:23:38.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How else can I guide your hand? Relax</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.506" end="00:23:38.506" style="s2">your wrist. Loosen your grip.</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.906" end="00:23:46.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I I can write it myself.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.506" end="00:23:49.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay still.</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.906" end="00:23:49.706" style="s2">Follow my lead.</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.506" end="00:24:04.406" style="s2">For a royal courtesy, keep your back</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.306" end="00:24:07.706" style="s2">straight.</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.406" end="00:24:07.706" style="s2">Put your weight on your back foot.</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.531" end="00:24:12.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.806" end="00:24:12.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like this?</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.806" end="00:24:16.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. You&#39;re too stiff.</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.286" end="00:24:25.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.561" end="00:24:28.581" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.007" end="00:24:51.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry. I fell asleep reading.</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.607" end="00:24:55.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Up this late studying banquet etiquette?</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.408" end="00:24:58.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to learn more. I don&#39;t want to</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.707" end="00:24:58.408" style="s2">embarrass you.</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.207" end="00:25:03.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.507" end="00:25:04.507" style="s2">Our annual banquet is next week.</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.507" end="00:25:05.507" style="s2">You can host it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.507" end="00:25:07.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me?</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.507" end="00:25:10.408" style="s2">I&#39;ve never hosted one.</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.107" end="00:25:13.107" style="s2">What if I ruin it and embarrass you?</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.408" end="00:25:14.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I taught you myself. You&#39;ll do well.</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.107" end="00:25:16.707" style="s2">And if anything goes wrong, I&#39;ll handle</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.507" end="00:25:16.707" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.107" end="00:25:21.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.307" end="00:25:21.107" style="s2">I won&#39;t let you down.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.408" end="00:25:26.307" style="s2">Replace these flowers with red roses.</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.107" end="00:25:26.307" style="s2">The foreign envoys prefer them.</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.607" end="00:25:33.107" style="s2">Use only sterling silver. Check every</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.507" end="00:25:36.107" style="s2">piece. Not a single scratch.</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.107" end="00:25:36.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, your majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.507" end="00:25:43.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She really carries herself like a queen</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.908" end="00:25:46.307" style="s2">now. She knows so much.</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.307" end="00:25:46.307" style="s2">This is mixed curious.</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.472" end="00:25:52.307" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.408" end="00:25:52.307" style="s2">A lowly human ordering dragons around.</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.107" end="00:25:59.107" style="s2">Just wait.</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.707" end="00:25:59.107" style="s2">I will ruin you at that banquet.</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.007" end="00:26:07.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This banquet is awesome.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.707" end="00:26:08.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. I&#39;m glad you&#39;re all enjoying</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.408" end="00:26:10.007" style="s2">yourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.307" end="00:26:12.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I doubted a human could manage this.</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.007" end="00:26:15.107" style="s2">She&#39;s thought of everything. Indeed, his</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.107" end="00:26:15.107" style="s2">majesty chose well.</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.007" end="00:26:28.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A royal treasure has been stolen, and</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.107" end="00:26:30.709" style="s2">this filthy human is the thief.</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.807" end="00:26:34.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a lie. I&#39;ve been here all</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.709" end="00:26:36.609" style="s2">evening. I never went near the treasury.</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.309" end="00:26:38.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then a search will prove it.</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.609" end="00:26:40.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.218" end="00:26:40.238" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.148" end="00:26:44.168" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.109" end="00:26:49.609" style="s2">Look everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.609" end="00:26:49.609" style="s2">Caught red-handed.</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.809" end="00:26:58.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Greedy humans rotten to the core.</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.109" end="00:27:00.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s unfit TO BE QUEEN. THROW HER OUT.</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.609" end="00:27:02.109" style="s2">I DIDN&#39;T DO IT. I DON&#39;T KNOW HOW THAT</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.609" end="00:27:04.009" style="s2">GOT THERE.</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.109" end="00:27:05.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The proof is right here.</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.009" end="00:27:08.609" style="s2">Still denying it?</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.509" end="00:27:08.609" style="s2">Get out of our kingdom.</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.518" end="00:27:19.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.609" end="00:27:27.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lay a hand on my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.909" end="00:27:27.609" style="s2">I dare you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.609" end="00:27:33.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, she stole the treasure.</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.909" end="00:27:35.009" style="s2">Everyone saw it.</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.709" end="00:27:38.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did they?</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.009" end="00:27:38.509" style="s2">Then let&#39;s see what really happened.</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.749" end="00:28:03.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.404" end="00:28:03.424" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.509" end="00:28:07.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.509" end="00:28:08.709" style="s2">It wasn&#39;t like that. Your Majesty,</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.509" end="00:28:10.309" style="s2">please. I only</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.709" end="00:28:12.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silence.</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.309" end="00:28:15.909" style="s2">You framed my queen under my roof.</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.809" end="00:28:15.909" style="s2">Do you have a death wish?</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.109" end="00:28:18.709" style="s2">Guards,</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.309" end="00:28:22.009" style="s2">take her to the dungeon. She is never to</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.709" end="00:28:22.009" style="s2">set foot in my castle again.</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.409" end="00:28:26.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, please. Karen. Karen.</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.409" end="00:28:37.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s over. I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.910" end="00:28:37.610" style="s2">No one will hurt you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.084" end="00:28:40.104" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.210" end="00:28:46.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.410" end="00:28:51.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May I have this dance, my beautiful</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.110" end="00:28:51.410" style="s2">queen?</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.595" end="00:29:08.910" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.560" end="00:29:11.610" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.910" end="00:29:14.910" style="s2">You look so beautiful tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.610" end="00:29:14.910" style="s2">I don&#39;t want anyone else to see you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.110" end="00:29:19.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you jealous?</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.110" end="00:29:29.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you think?</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.010" end="00:29:41.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for what you did back there.</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.550" end="00:29:47.570" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.510" end="00:29:52.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that all the thanks I get?</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.200" end="00:30:08.510" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.165" end="00:30:11.310" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.510" end="00:30:11.310" style="s2">That&#39;s not enough.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.510" end="00:30:23.010" style="s2">Karen, why should you have it all?</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.910" end="00:30:29.110" style="s2">Your throne, your woman.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.310" end="00:30:31.810" style="s2">I&#39;ll destroy everything you have piece</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.110" end="00:30:31.810" style="s2">by piece.</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.710" end="00:30:41.212" style="s2">Our queen seems happy.</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.412" end="00:30:44.912" style="s2">Too bad it&#39;s all a lie.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.212" end="00:30:48.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s that supposed to mean? Move.</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.912" end="00:30:50.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Karen has a mistress. You didn&#39;t know?</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.512" end="00:30:54.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop trying to come between us. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.712" end="00:30:54.112" style="s2">believe you. Get lost.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.712" end="00:30:58.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s true this time.</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.412" end="00:31:00.612" style="s2">She&#39;s at Emerald Lake.</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.412" end="00:31:01.712" style="s2">Go see for yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.612" end="00:31:04.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.712" end="00:31:04.612" style="s2">I&#39;ll prove you&#39;re lying.</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.112" end="00:31:07.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look over there.</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.526" end="00:31:22.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.351" end="00:31:32.371" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.012" end="00:31:39.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, you should drink too much.</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.812" end="00:31:41.412" style="s2">That liquor is too strong.</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.412" end="00:31:43.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LEAVE ME ALONE. GET [clears throat] OUT.</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.412" end="00:31:47.212" style="s2">I WANT MORE.</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.012" end="00:31:47.212" style="s2">KAREN&#39;S A JERK, that liar.</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.812" end="00:31:53.812" style="s2">He promised he wouldn&#39;t lie.</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.612" end="00:31:53.812" style="s2">Men are all the same.</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.912" end="00:31:59.412" style="s2">Good heavens, you mustn&#39;t say that. Let</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.312" end="00:31:59.412" style="s2">me take you back to your room.</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.012" end="00:32:04.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not going BACK TO THAT DAMN ROOM.</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.687" end="00:32:09.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.617" end="00:32:13.637" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.212" end="00:32:18.167" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WELL, WHO&#39;S THIS?</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.912" end="00:32:18.212" style="s2">You look just like that liar.</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.167" end="00:32:22.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.212" end="00:32:22.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you done? Look at yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.012" end="00:32:27.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go. Don&#39;t touch me. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.012" end="00:32:30.012" style="s2">disgusting.</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.992" end="00:32:30.012" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.197" end="00:32:39.713" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.912" end="00:32:39.713" style="s2">What are you doing? Put down.</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.437" end="00:32:42.457" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.313" end="00:32:47.113" style="s2">Go find your elf lady. Why do you care</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.213" end="00:32:49.713" style="s2">what I do?</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.113" end="00:32:49.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.947" end="00:33:10.567" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.912" end="00:33:12.587" style="s2">[gasps and panting]</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.567" end="00:33:12.587" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.113" end="00:33:17.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you? Who said you could touch</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.713" end="00:33:19.793" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.773" end="00:33:19.793" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.413" end="00:33:25.113" style="s2">Wow.</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.813" end="00:33:28.113" style="s2">Abs.</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.113" end="00:33:28.113" style="s2">That feels nice.</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.813" end="00:33:32.183" style="s2">A body like this deserves to be</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.513" end="00:33:34.203" style="s2">appreciated.</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.183" end="00:33:34.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.213" end="00:33:40.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leah, stop.</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.513" end="00:33:40.313" style="s2">Do you know what you&#39;re doing?</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.513" end="00:33:47.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Make me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.713" end="00:33:47.813" style="s2">What are you going to do about it?</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.868" end="00:33:51.888" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.713" end="00:33:57.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little tease.</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.243" end="00:34:08.513" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.898" end="00:34:10.013" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.513" end="00:34:12.413" style="s2">Awake?</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.013" end="00:34:15.313" style="s2">All that biting and touching last night.</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.413" end="00:34:15.313" style="s2">Enjoy yourself?</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.068" end="00:34:19.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.813" end="00:34:19.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You pervert!</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.813" end="00:34:37.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why so grumpy this morning?</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.913" end="00:34:39.113" style="s2">You were the one all over me last night.</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.313" end="00:34:40.958" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As if I want you.</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.113" end="00:34:42.923" style="s2">Go find elf lady.</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.958" end="00:34:44.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.923" end="00:34:46.114" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.714" end="00:34:48.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.114" end="00:34:50.614" style="s2">Jealous?</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.014" end="00:34:53.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, you liar. You snuck out to see her</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.614" end="00:34:53.214" style="s2">yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.914" end="00:34:59.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s a jeweler.</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.614" end="00:34:59.714" style="s2">I was buying you a gift.</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.714" end="00:35:07.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A gift</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.114" end="00:35:07.614" style="s2">for me?</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.614" end="00:35:21.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wear this</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.914" end="00:35:21.314" style="s2">and I&#39;ll find you wherever you are.</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.514" end="00:35:26.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.414" end="00:35:26.414" style="s2">didn&#39;t you tell me earlier?</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.814" end="00:35:34.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Between the kisses and the bites, did</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.514" end="00:35:34.314" style="s2">you give me a charm?</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.914" end="00:35:40.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well,</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.114" end="00:35:40.814" style="s2">I got the wrong idea. I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.714" end="00:35:52.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just sorry?</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.514" end="00:35:54.974" style="s2">You believe someone else over me. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.214" end="00:35:56.994" style="s2">you owe me something?</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.974" end="00:35:56.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.814" end="00:36:07.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In your dreams, you shameless pervert.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.765" end="00:36:09.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.420" end="00:36:09.440" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.614" end="00:36:13.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I&#39;m a pervert, I might as well earn</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.114" end="00:36:13.314" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.614" end="00:36:23.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, we&#39;ve confirmed it. Marcus</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.514" end="00:36:26.314" style="s2">has been spreading lies to drive you</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.914" end="00:36:26.314" style="s2">apart.</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.414" end="00:36:31.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Strip Marcus of all his privileges.</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.714" end="00:36:33.514" style="s2">Banish him from our lands</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.514" end="00:36:35.814" style="s2">forever.</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.514" end="00:36:38.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; KAREN!</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.814" end="00:36:41.314" style="s2">YOU WOULDN&#39;T DARE. YOU HAVE NO RIGHT TO</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.614" end="00:36:44.516" style="s2">BANISH ME.</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.314" end="00:36:44.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET HIM OUT OF TO MY PALACE.</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.685" end="00:36:49.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.816" end="00:36:51.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO.</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.716" end="00:36:54.616" style="s2">I&#39;m not leaving.</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.116" end="00:36:54.616" style="s2">YOU FORCED MY HAND.</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.510" end="00:37:04.416" style="s2">[snorts] KAREN,</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.216" end="00:37:04.416" style="s2">YOU&#39;RE GOING TO HELL WITH ME.</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.316" end="00:37:35.116" style="s2">THE CURSE IS BACK, KAREN.</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.716" end="00:37:35.116" style="s2">YOU&#39;RE running out of time.</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.256" end="00:37:52.276" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.081" end="00:38:02.101" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.916" end="00:38:05.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Karen, try to eat something.</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.321" end="00:38:08.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cough]</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.916" end="00:38:08.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It [snorts] hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.716" end="00:38:11.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Again?</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.816" end="00:38:14.116" style="s2">Did your wound reopen? I&#39;ll get the</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.716" end="00:38:14.116" style="s2">healer.</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.916" end="00:38:17.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t go.</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.111" end="00:38:20.216" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.816" end="00:38:22.351" style="s2">The healer can&#39;t help.</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.216" end="00:38:23.716" style="s2">It doesn&#39;t hurt when you&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.351" end="00:38:24.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.716" end="00:38:27.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.816" end="00:38:27.716" style="s2">I&#39;m not going anywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.521" end="00:38:34.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.716" end="00:38:34.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; More.</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.716" end="00:38:40.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.616" end="00:38:43.311" style="s2">lie still, will you?</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.316" end="00:38:45.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My heart&#39;s racing. It hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.311" end="00:38:45.331" style="s2">[gasps and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.586" end="00:38:49.717" style="s2">[snorts] Ah, that hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.861" end="00:38:53.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.117" end="00:38:56.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. I&#39;ll look after you until</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.017" end="00:38:56.517" style="s2">you&#39;re better. I promise.</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.996" end="00:39:05.117" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.717" end="00:39:05.117" style="s2">It&#39;s cooled down. Here, eat.</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.822" end="00:39:13.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.417" end="00:39:16.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It still hurts so much. I barely have</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.617" end="00:39:20.017" style="s2">any strength.</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.217" end="00:39:20.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did you hurt your wound again?</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.217" end="00:39:27.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.217" end="00:39:27.217" style="s2">a kiss would make it better.</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.317" end="00:39:37.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still hurting? Lie still. I&#39;ll get a</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.817" end="00:39:37.717" style="s2">warm cloth for you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.817" end="00:40:05.417" style="s2">So injured, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.317" end="00:40:07.217" style="s2">No strength at all, huh? You crushed a</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.417" end="00:40:10.017" style="s2">walnut with one hand. That&#39;s your idea</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.217" end="00:40:11.117" style="s2">of badly hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.017" end="00:40:12.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well,</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.117" end="00:40:13.117" style="s2">well,</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.217" end="00:40:15.617" style="s2">would you believe I just made a</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.117" end="00:40:18.217" style="s2">miraculous recovery?</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.617" end="00:40:18.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You liar.</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.317" end="00:40:21.917" style="s2">I cried over you for nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.117" end="00:40:28.817" style="s2">Let go, you liar.</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.457" end="00:40:30.078" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and panting]</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.817" end="00:40:31.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.078" end="00:40:33.917" style="s2">[snorts] Didn&#39;t you promise to do</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.217" end="00:40:33.917" style="s2">anything for me?</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.007" end="00:40:37.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.317" end="00:40:37.338" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.917" end="00:40:44.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, your mother is back. She</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.117" end="00:40:44.217" style="s2">demands to see the Queen.</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.417" end="00:40:48.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Release Cerila.</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.917" end="00:40:49.518" style="s2">She doesn&#39;t belong in that filthy</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.118" end="00:40:50.718" style="s2">dungeon.</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.518" end="00:40:53.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.718" end="00:40:54.718" style="s2">She went after Lia. She must pay for it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:53.658" end="00:40:58.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.718" end="00:41:00.208" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An elder&#39;s noble daughter a lowly human?</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.518" end="00:41:02.228" style="s2">Absurd.</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.208" end="00:41:02.228" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.418" end="00:41:06.818" style="s2">Nobility is about character, not blood.</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.218" end="00:41:09.118" style="s2">Serena did wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.818" end="00:41:10.618" style="s2">She must answer for it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.118" end="00:41:12.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Answer to you?</p>
<p begin="00:41:10.618" end="00:41:15.318" style="s2">A lowly human?</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.318" end="00:41:15.318" style="s2">Perhaps you set her up.</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.118" end="00:41:20.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She framed me in front of every guest.</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.318" end="00:41:23.118" style="s2">If you doubt me, call them in and ask.</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.718" end="00:41:25.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Such a sharp tongue.</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.118" end="00:41:27.718" style="s2">Marrying the king doesn&#39;t give you right</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.318" end="00:41:29.118" style="s2">to defy me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.718" end="00:41:31.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother,</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.118" end="00:41:34.918" style="s2">Lia is the only one who can touch me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.718" end="00:41:34.918" style="s2">She is my lawful queen.</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.718" end="00:41:42.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena would endure your curse to stay</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.818" end="00:41:44.518" style="s2">beside you. She&#39;s far better than this</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.018" end="00:41:44.518" style="s2">human.</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.918" end="00:41:51.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want her.</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.218" end="00:41:51.918" style="s2">Lia is the only queen I&#39;ll ever have.</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.518" end="00:41:58.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.918" end="00:41:58.618" style="s2">Very well.</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.518" end="00:42:09.118" style="s2">I&#39;ll expose her.</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.318" end="00:42:11.918" style="s2">You&#39;ll see exactly what kind of human</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.118" end="00:42:11.918" style="s2">you&#39;re protecting.</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.218" end="00:42:22.618" style="s2">Set places for the frost wells and the</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.118" end="00:42:25.718" style="s2">ember waves.</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.618" end="00:42:25.718" style="s2">You have seven minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.418" end="00:42:34.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Frost wrecks prefer the cold.</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.318" end="00:42:36.418" style="s2">Blue crystal keeps frost wine perfectly</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.118" end="00:42:38.718" style="s2">chilled.</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.418" end="00:42:42.418" style="s2">Ember hex are bold by nature. Obnion</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.718" end="00:42:42.418" style="s2">cups withstand the heat of lava brew.</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.664" end="00:42:48.918" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.318" end="00:42:52.620" style="s2">Memorizing a book proves nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.918" end="00:42:52.620" style="s2">Our customs aren&#39;t that simple.</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.520" end="00:43:00.320" style="s2">A queen must carry herself perfectly at</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.320" end="00:43:02.920" style="s2">all times. [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.320" end="00:43:05.620" style="s2">Walk up here with those books. Drop one</p>
<p begin="00:43:02.920" end="00:43:05.620" style="s2">and you&#39;re out.</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.720" end="00:43:24.520" style="s2">Does my posture meet your standards,</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.120" end="00:43:24.520" style="s2">mother?</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.820" end="00:43:27.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You pass.</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.120" end="00:43:30.420" style="s2">Barely.</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.720" end="00:43:33.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, customs can be learned,</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.420" end="00:43:33.920" style="s2">but does she truly love your son?</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.120" end="00:43:38.065" style="s2">Why not test her?</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.520" end="00:43:39.020" style="s2">See if she&#39;d risk her life to save him.</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.065" end="00:43:40.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.020" end="00:43:42.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very well.</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.320" end="00:43:44.520" style="s2">If she&#39;s a coward, she&#39;s unfit to be</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.020" end="00:43:44.520" style="s2">queen.</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.120" end="00:43:50.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother, Leah passed your test. It&#39;s time</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.420" end="00:43:52.020" style="s2">for you to leave.</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.520" end="00:43:53.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;d send your own mother away for this</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.020" end="00:43:56.220" style="s2">human?</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.220" end="00:43:57.220" style="s2">Fine. I&#39;ll leave, but on one condition.</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.220" end="00:43:59.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What condition?</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.220" end="00:44:01.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow I&#39;ll send a beast after you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.320" end="00:44:02.120" style="s2">It&#39;ll be under my control. Play along.</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.320" end="00:44:03.820" style="s2">No magic.</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.120" end="00:44:04.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely not. You&#39;ll scare her half to</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.820" end="00:44:06.020" style="s2">death.</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.120" end="00:44:07.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the point. I want to see if</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.020" end="00:44:08.520" style="s2">she&#39;ll abandon you when your life is on</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.420" end="00:44:09.920" style="s2">the line.</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.520" end="00:44:11.420" style="s2">If she stays by your side, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.920" end="00:44:13.920" style="s2">recognize her as your queen and leave at</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.420" end="00:44:13.920" style="s2">once.</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.120" end="00:44:17.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.220" end="00:44:17.820" style="s2">You have a deal.</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.220" end="00:44:21.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if she runs and never looks back,</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.620" end="00:44:23.120" style="s2">aren&#39;t you afraid the whole clan will</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.920" end="00:44:24.720" style="s2">laugh at you?</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.120" end="00:44:26.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leah won&#39;t run.</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.720" end="00:44:28.720" style="s2">Tomorrow she&#39;ll prove you wrong about</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.520" end="00:44:28.720" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.085" end="00:44:35.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.461" end="00:44:54.620" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.620" end="00:44:54.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; KAREN, GET OUT OF THE WAY.</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.021" end="00:45:12.721" style="s2">DIE, YOU BEAST.</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.521" end="00:45:35.821" style="s2">You foolish girl.</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.621" end="00:45:35.821" style="s2">You really would die for him.</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.321" end="00:45:47.221" style="s2">Cry out if it hurts. You don&#39;t have to</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.521" end="00:45:51.421" style="s2">be brave.</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.221" end="00:45:53.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine. I can handle this little pain.</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.421" end="00:45:55.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why didn&#39;t you run?</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.321" end="00:45:57.421" style="s2">That beast could have eaten you.</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.921" end="00:45:58.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Karen was there.</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.421" end="00:46:00.921" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t leave him.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.721" end="00:46:03.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Humans are liars.</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.921" end="00:46:04.821" style="s2">Our ancestors trusted your kind. It cost</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.721" end="00:46:07.421" style="s2">them their lives.</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.821" end="00:46:10.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I would never betray him. I love him.</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.421" end="00:46:10.621" style="s2">I&#39;d give my life for him.</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.521" end="00:46:20.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.821" end="00:46:20.121" style="s2">I was a fool to doubt you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.721" end="00:46:25.121" style="s2">Take good care of Karen for me.</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.421" end="00:46:37.521" style="s2">Well, I&#39;d best be going.</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.221" end="00:46:39.721" style="s2">You two should get to work.</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.521" end="00:46:41.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On what?</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.721" end="00:46:43.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Giving me a grandchild. This place is</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.821" end="00:46:44.087" style="s2">far too quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.432" end="00:46:46.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.087" end="00:46:46.107" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.621" end="00:47:01.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You heard her.</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.221" end="00:47:01.723" style="s2">We&#39;ve been ordered to make a baby.</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.122" end="00:47:10.622" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.723" end="00:47:12.823" style="s2">You seem far away.</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.622" end="00:47:16.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I miss my mum.</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.823" end="00:47:16.523" style="s2">I wonder how she&#39;s managing all alone.</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.223" end="00:47:26.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go get ready.</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.622" end="00:47:26.523" style="s2">I&#39;ll take you to see her.</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.592" end="00:47:32.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter and snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.723" end="00:48:14.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WAIT! WAIT! WAIT!</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.513" end="00:48:14.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.788" end="00:48:17.808" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.338" end="00:48:24.358" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.958" end="00:48:27.223" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.323" end="00:48:30.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NOT BAD, YOUR MAJESTY.</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.223" end="00:48:30.023" style="s2">YOU&#39;RE QUITE THE RUNNER.</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.723" end="00:48:43.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HEY, no sneak attacks.</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.848" end="00:48:51.868" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.673" end="00:49:02.924" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.422" end="00:49:05.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t you two a little old to fall in</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.924" end="00:49:07.824" style="s2">the creek? Have some hot soup before you</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.124" end="00:49:07.824" style="s2">catch a cold.</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.724" end="00:49:14.524" style="s2">All that chopping and milking must have</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.024" end="00:49:18.324" style="s2">worn you out.</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.524" end="00:49:18.324" style="s2">This is your home, too. Eat up.</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.724" end="00:49:27.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.124" end="00:49:27.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Slow down. It&#39;s all yours.</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.734" end="00:49:35.699" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.389" end="00:49:37.719" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.699" end="00:49:37.719" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.024" end="00:49:42.424" style="s2">Can you move over a little? I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.824" end="00:49:42.424" style="s2">squashed.</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.524" end="00:49:48.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop wriggling.</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.124" end="00:49:52.074" style="s2">This bed&#39;s tiny. You&#39;ll fall off.</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.924" end="00:49:53.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Liar. Half of you is still on the bed.</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.074" end="00:49:55.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.124" end="00:49:57.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leah, let me hold you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.124" end="00:49:57.924" style="s2">It&#39;s been a long day.</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.899" end="00:50:06.924" style="s2">[snorts] Sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.524" end="00:50:06.924" style="s2">I&#39;ve got you. You won&#39;t fall.</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.124" end="00:50:12.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re leaving, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.824" end="00:50:12.724" style="s2">Take care of yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.724" end="00:50:17.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. I&#39;m perfectly healthy.</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.964" end="00:50:19.724" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.924" end="00:50:21.549" style="s2">Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.724" end="00:50:22.424" style="s2">there&#39;s something I haven&#39;t told you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.549" end="00:50:23.824" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.424" end="00:50:25.624" style="s2">Our marriage is just a six-month</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.824" end="00:50:27.224" style="s2">contract.</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.624" end="00:50:28.824" style="s2">It&#39;s almost over.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.224" end="00:50:31.624" style="s2">I want to stay, but I&#39;m scared. What if</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.824" end="00:50:31.624" style="s2">he doesn&#39;t need me?</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.724" end="00:50:35.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetheart,</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.024" end="00:50:38.224" style="s2">if you can&#39;t bear to lose him, then</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.224" end="00:50:38.224" style="s2">fight for what you want.</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.724" end="00:50:41.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.324" end="00:50:56.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Karen?</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.324" end="00:50:59.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get some sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.624" end="00:50:59.324" style="s2">We&#39;ll be home soon.</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.225" end="00:51:13.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your majesty, the priest has been</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.725" end="00:51:15.525" style="s2">waiting in your study. He says it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.125" end="00:51:15.525" style="s2">urgent.</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.625" end="00:51:19.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take a bath and get some rest.</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.425" end="00:51:26.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll wait up for you tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.085" end="00:51:29.725" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.925" end="00:51:29.725" style="s2">Karen, I&#39;m ready.</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.225" end="00:51:33.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait for me.</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.325" end="00:51:54.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why isn&#39;t he back?</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.225" end="00:51:56.580" style="s2">Is something wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.560" end="00:51:56.580" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.925" end="00:52:10.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wonderful, your majesty. If she</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.925" end="00:52:12.925" style="s2">willingly sleeps with you tonight, the</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.525" end="00:52:16.925" style="s2">curse will finally be broken. After all</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.925" end="00:52:16.925" style="s2">this time, she&#39;s finally willing.</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.106" end="00:52:22.126" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps and laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.325" end="00:52:32.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You liar.</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.125" end="00:52:32.606" style="s2">YOU FILTHY LIAR. [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.825" end="00:52:39.525" style="s2">HE ONLY CARED for me to break his curse.</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.825" end="00:52:39.525" style="s2">I was just a means to an end.</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.961" end="00:52:48.981" style="s2">[gasps and laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.825" end="00:53:01.525" style="s2">Marcus.</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.125" end="00:53:07.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You and Karen got me banished.</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.525" end="00:53:08.727" style="s2">But that&#39;s all right.</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.227" end="00:53:10.541" style="s2">Once you&#39;re dead, he&#39;ll follow soon</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.727" end="00:53:12.561" style="s2">enough.</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.541" end="00:53:12.561" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.627" end="00:53:22.927" style="s2">Take her. Dump her in the Frozen Wilds.</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.027" end="00:53:34.527" style="s2">LEAH!</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.327" end="00:53:36.127" style="s2">COME OUT. THIS ISN&#39;T FUNNY.</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.527" end="00:53:39.027" style="s2">WHERE IS SHE?</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.127" end="00:53:39.027" style="s2">HOW COULD SHE DISAPPEAR?</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.027" end="00:53:49.842" style="s2">NO.</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.427" end="00:53:50.527" style="s2">She&#39;s in the Frozen Wilds.</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.842" end="00:53:51.727" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.527" end="00:53:54.727" style="s2">She&#39;s human.</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.727" end="00:53:54.727" style="s2">She&#39;ll freeze to death there.</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.027" end="00:54:02.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty,</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.527" end="00:54:04.027" style="s2">where are you going?</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.127" end="00:54:06.327" style="s2">You mustn&#39;t use magic. The curse IS</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.027" end="00:54:09.827" style="s2">ABOUT TO FLARE UP.</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.327" end="00:54:09.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whoever hurts her dies.</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.127" end="00:54:38.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So cold.</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.027" end="00:54:38.327" style="s2">I can barely feel the pain.</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.027" end="00:54:44.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poor thing.</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.927" end="00:54:44.727" style="s2">You are going to die here alone.</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.827" end="00:54:50.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.927" end="00:54:50.427" style="s2">do it.</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.227" end="00:54:56.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go to hell.</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.753" end="00:55:13.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.028" end="00:55:13.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.428" end="00:55:25.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.328" end="00:55:25.728" style="s2">I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.128" end="00:55:28.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.783" end="00:55:28.803" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.928" end="00:55:38.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Die.</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.158" end="00:55:45.178" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.433" end="00:55:49.928" style="s2">[gasps and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.528" end="00:55:49.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Karen.</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.628" end="00:55:55.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a dead man.</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.978" end="00:56:13.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.908" end="00:56:18.228" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:56:16.428" end="00:56:20.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be afraid, Leah.</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.228" end="00:56:23.113" style="s2">I&#39;m taking you home.</p>
<p begin="00:56:20.728" end="00:56:25.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch me.</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.113" end="00:56:25.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.728" end="00:56:29.008" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leah,</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.428" end="00:56:31.028" style="s2">what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.008" end="00:56:34.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.028" end="00:56:38.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a liar. None of it was real.</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.228" end="00:56:38.228" style="s2">You were using me to break your curse.</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.489" end="00:56:41.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.928" end="00:56:48.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s how it started.</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.728" end="00:56:51.928" style="s2">But I swear it&#39;s different now.</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.528" end="00:56:51.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll never believe you again.</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.244" end="00:56:56.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.628" end="00:56:59.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IF YOU WERE JUST MY CURE, WHY WOULD I</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.428" end="00:56:59.828" style="s2">RISK MY LIFE FOR YOU?</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.449" end="00:57:02.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.759" end="00:57:06.344" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.528" end="00:57:06.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET GO OF ME, YOU LIAR.</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.344" end="00:57:09.019" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.999" end="00:57:09.019" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.584" end="00:57:15.569" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:57:13.549" end="00:57:15.569" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.129" end="00:57:25.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to trust my words,</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.629" end="00:57:27.229" style="s2">but my heart can&#39;t lie.</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.529" end="00:57:30.129" style="s2">Listen.</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.229" end="00:57:30.129" style="s2">It beats for you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.729" end="00:57:37.129" style="s2">Leah,</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.529" end="00:57:37.129" style="s2">I love you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.749" end="00:57:41.769" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.334" end="00:57:48.319" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.299" end="00:57:48.319" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.260" end="00:58:09.280" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.190" end="00:58:13.129" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.029" end="00:58:16.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Karen,</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.129" end="00:58:16.429" style="s2">wake up. What&#39;s happening?</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.929" end="00:58:24.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hurry. The curse has taken hold. Get His</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.029" end="00:58:24.229" style="s2">Majesty back to the castle.</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.929" end="00:58:40.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leah!</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.905" end="00:58:47.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:58:51.529" end="00:58:54.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Karen, I&#39;m ending this contract.</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.730" end="00:58:58.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.529" end="00:59:00.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.729" end="00:59:03.129" style="s2">You still can&#39;t forgive me?</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.529" end="00:59:03.129" style="s2">You&#39;re leaving?</p>
<p begin="00:59:15.029" end="00:59:20.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want to be your cure anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.000" end="00:59:20.020" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:59:23.431" end="00:59:27.331" style="s2">Karen,</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.331" end="00:59:29.791" style="s2">I want to be your wife</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.331" end="00:59:31.431" style="s2">for real.</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.791" end="00:59:33.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.431" end="00:59:35.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you know</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.031" end="00:59:35.731" style="s2">what you&#39;re saying?</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.431" end="00:59:39.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Karen, I want you.</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.271" end="00:59:42.291" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.231" end="00:59:52.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, sis, run faster.</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.031" end="00:59:52.931" style="s2">Wait for me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.131" end="01:00:03.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Slow down. You&#39;ll fall.</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.231" end="01:00:04.931" style="s2">Mommy&#39;s cooking tonight. I&#39;ll make you</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.131" end="01:00:08.431" style="s2">something yummy.</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.931" end="01:00:08.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, no, you&#39;ll blow up the kitchen.</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.531" end="01:00:14.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nonsense.</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.831" end="01:00:22.731" style="s2">Your mommy makes the best food in the</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.331" end="01:00:22.731" style="s2">world.</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.531" end="01:00:29.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You spoil me.</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.031" end="01:00:36.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re my queen.</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.531" end="01:00:36.131" style="s2">Of course I do.</p>
<p begin="01:00:45.831" end="01:00:49.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, carry me.</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.031" end="01:00:51.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.231" end="01:00:51.531" style="s2">Up you go.</p>
<p begin="01:00:52.322" end="01:00:55.651" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:00:53.631" end="01:00:55.651" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
